Package: myscoutee
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MyScoutee <admin@myscoutee.local>
Depends: bash, coreutils, docker.io | docker-ce, docker-compose-plugin | docker-compose-v2
Recommends: curl, jq, gnupg, openssl, ufw, ncdu, iotop, redis-tools
Description: MyScoutee production bundle
 Production packaging metadata for the MyScoutee Docker-based VPS deploy.
 The package is expected to install the application bundle, systemd unit,
 and operational helper scripts. Docker is a package dependency; optional
 server convenience tools remain recommendations.
